  "description": "## Summary\n\n1. **Request**: Use `ChatSidebarNode` component for the root task instead of the hardcoded root chat card.\n\n2. **Analysis**: Identified that the root chat was using custom markup with project selector, title, description, and button styling, while child tasks used the `ChatSidebarNode` component.\n\n3. **Solution**: Replaced the hardcoded root chat card with `ChatSidebarNode` component, maintaining consistency across all task nodes.\n\n4. **Implementation**: Kept the `ProjectDetailt` selector in a separate wrapper above the root node to preserve project selection functionality in non-compact mode.\n\n5. **Result**: Simplified `ChatSidebar.vue` by using the same `ChatSidebarNode` component for both root and child tasks, improving code reusability and maintainability.",
